{"parse": {"title": "Mort'ton local", "pageid": 94028, "revid": 15318038, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{External|rs}}\n{{Infobox NPC\n|version1 = Level 30 Afflicted\n|version2 = Level 32 Afflicted\n|version3 = Level 34 Afflicted\n|version4 = Level 37 Afflicted\n|name1 = Mort'ton local\n|name2 = Mort'ton local\n|name3 = Mort'ton Local\n|name4 = Mort'ton Local\n|image1 = [[File:Mort'ton local (level 30).png|120px]]\n|image2 = [[File:Mort'ton local (level 32).png|130px]]\n|image3 = [[File:Mort'ton local (level 34).png|120px]]\n|image4 = [[File:Mort'ton local (level 37).png|130px]]\n|release = [[18 October]] [[2004]]\n|update = Mortton Shades and Mage Armour\n|members = Yes\n|race = [[Human]]\n|quest = [[Shades of Mort'ton]]\n|location = [[Mort'ton]]\n|options = Talk-to\n|examine = A local villager of Mort'ton.\n|map = No\n|id1 = 1296\n|id2 = 1295\n|id3 = 1292\n|id4 = 1291\n|leagueRegion = Morytania\n}}\n{{Synced switch\n|version1 = [[File:Mort'ton local (level 30) chathead.png|left]]\n|version2 = [[File:Mort'ton local (level 32) chathead.png|left]]\n|version3 = [[File:Mort'ton local (level 34) chathead.png|left]]\n|version4 = [[File:Mort'ton local (level 37) chathead.png|left]]\n}}\n'''Mort'ton locals''' are the result of using [[Serum 207]] or [[Serum 208]] on the [[afflicted]] in [[Mort'ton]] during or after the [[Shades of Mort'ton]] quest. As thanks for curing them of the Sanguinesti Affliction, they will reward you with some items, with Serum 208 providing slightly better rewards than Serum 207.\n\nThey revert to their afflicted state a short while after being cured, even when Serum 208 is used, which is supposed to cure affliction permanently.\n\nIf you attack the afflicted with a magic or ranged attack, then use a Serum before the damage is taken, you will get both the reward and a drop. The local will die with 1 hitpoint.\n\n==Cure rewards==\n===Serum 207===\n{{DropLogProject|kills=3,389}}\n\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=Morytania|dropversion=Serum 207}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Coins|quantity=10-20|rarity=59/256|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Swamp paste|quantity=1-20|rarity=26/256}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Olive oil(1)|quantity=1-3|rarity=20/256}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Olive oil(2)|quantity=1-3|rarity=15/256}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Olive oil(3)|quantity=1|rarity=8/256}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Olive oil(4)|quantity=1|rarity=11/256}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Vial of water|quantity=1-3|rarity=30/256}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Logs|quantity=1-5|rarity=40/256}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Grimy tarromin|quantity=1-3|rarity=34/256}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Hammer|quantity=1|rarity=3/256}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Vial|quantity=1-3|rarity=10/256}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Serum 208===\n{{DropLogProject|kills=8682|type=cures}}\n\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=Morytania|dropversion=Serum 208}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Coins|quantity=30-40|rarity=30/128|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Grimy tarromin|quantity=2-5|rarity=16/128}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Limestone brick|quantity=1-5|rarity=14/128}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Swamp paste|quantity=10-35|rarity=14/128}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Olive oil(1)|quantity=2-5|rarity=10/128}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Olive oil(2)|quantity=2-5|rarity=7/128}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Olive oil(4)|quantity=1-3|rarity=5/128}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Logs|quantity=1-5|rarity=5/128}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Olive oil(3)|quantity=1-3|rarity=4/128}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Bronze key red|quantity=1|rarity=4/128|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Oak logs|quantity=1-5|rarity=4/128}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Bronze key crimson|quantity=1|rarity=3/128|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Bronze key brown|quantity=1|rarity=3/128|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Lean snail|quantity=1-3|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Thin snail|quantity=1-3|rarity=Uncommon}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Willow logs|quantity=1-5|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Maple logs|quantity=1-5|rarity=1/128}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Fat snail|quantity=1-3|rarity=1/128}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Dialogue==\n{{Hastranscript|npc}}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 26 July 2005\n|update - The Forgettable Tale...\n|change = The level 30 Mort'ton local's chathead was graphically updated.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 22 June 2005\n|update = Rogues Den + Tweaks\n|change = The level 30 and 34 Mort'ton locals' appearances were altered again with the second rework of female bodykits.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 31 May 2005\n|update = New Female Bodykit\n|change = The level 30 and 34 Mort'ton locals' appearances were altered with the rework of female bodykits.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|daterange = 26 April –<br/>6 June 2005\n|change = *The NPCs' combat levels were removed.\n*The NPCs now always appear below players standing in the same tile.\n*The level 32 and level 30 variants' \"Attack\" option was removed.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n===Gallery (historical)===\n<tabber>\nLevel 30=\n{|style=\"text-align: center\" cellpadding=\"15\"\n|[[File:Mort'ton local (level 30) (historical v1).png|center|300x150px]]\n|[[File:Mort'ton local (level 30) (historical v2).png|center|300x150px]]\n|[[File:Mort'ton local (level 30).png|300x150px]]\n|[[File:Mort'ton local (level 30).png|300x150px]]\n|-\n|[[File:Mort'ton local (level 30) chathead (historical).png]]\n|[[File:Mort'ton local (level 30) chathead (historical).png]]\n|[[File:Mort'ton local (level 30) chathead (historical).png]]\n|[[File:Mort'ton local (level 30) chathead.png]]\n|-\n|18 October 2004 –<br/>31 May 2005\n|31 May 2005 –<br/>22 June 2005\n|22 June 2005 –<br/>26 July 2005\n|26 July 2005 –<br/>present\n|}\n|-|\nLevel 34=\n{|style=\"text-align: center\" cellpadding=\"15\"\n|[[File:Mort'ton Local (level 34) (historical v1).png|center|300x150px]]\n|[[File:Mort'ton Local (level 34) (historical v2).png|center|300x150px]]\n|[[File:Mort'ton local (level 34).png|center|300x150px]]\n|-\n|18 October 2004 –